# Rafa's camera originals and the showreel master, about 191 MB in total.
# They are the *input* to tools/build-images.py and tools/build-video.sh, not
# something a public repository should carry: full resolution frames should
# not be downloadable from here, and an 86 MB .mov would sit in the history
# permanently. Keep them in this folder as they are; the generated web
# derivatives under site/assets/ are committed and are what the site serves.
#
# The leading slash anchors each pattern to the repository root, so nothing
# inside site/assets/ is affected.
/*.jpg
/*.JPG
/*.jpeg
/*.png
/*.mov
/*.mp4

# Screenshots of an earlier iteration of the design. They no longer match the
# site and would only mislead.
/preview/

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
